message: "If you use this harness, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "A random-signature null for ICI transcriptomic biomarkers"
abstract: >-
  Re-runnable null-calibration harness for benchmarking published
  immune-checkpoint-inhibitor response gene signatures against
  size-matched random gene sets across uniformly-processed public ICI
  cohorts.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
